  "summary": "Alacritty is a free and open-source GPU accelerated terminal emulator focused on performance and simplicity.",
  "description": "Alacritty is a modern terminal emulator that comes with sensible defaults, but allows for extensive configuration.\nBy integrating with other applications, rather than reimplementing their functionality, it manages to provide a flexible set of features with high performance.\nThe supported platforms currently consist of BSD, Linux, macOS and Windows.",
